.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
# ...but the TEMPLATE must ship. `.env.*` swallowed `.env.example`, so the file A-007 and
# HANDOFF.md both describe as "a committed .env.example" was never committed: it existed only
# on the author's disk, `check-secrets.sh` carried a carve-out for a path that could never be
# tracked, and its design note cited it as where the Anvil allowlist is documented — pointing a
# fresh clone at a file it does not have. Found by round five's free lens (C-4). It holds no
# secrets by construction; the guard scans it like any other tracked file.
!.env.example
node_modules/
out/
cache/
broadcast/
coverage/

# Foundry
contracts/out/
contracts/cache/
foundry.lock

# Node
ts/node_modules/

contracts/cache/

# Isolated signer runtime state: the default Unix socket path (ts/src/signer/main.ts).
# A socket is not a file to commit, and the directory is created at signer boot.
.sentinel/
